###

### Create Request – DUPLICATE identifier (409 Conflict)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/solicitudes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificador_externo": "EXT-TEST-001",
  "tipo": "soporte_tecnico",
  "nombre_solicitante": "Test User",
  "correo": "test.user@example.com",
  "descripcion": "Intento de duplicar el identificador EXT-TEST-001",
  "prioridad": "baja"
}

###

### Create Request – Invalid email (422 Unprocessable Entity)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/solicitudes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificador_externo": "EXT-ERR-001",
  "tipo": "soporte_tecnico",
  "nombre_solicitante": "Test User",
  "correo": "esto-no-es-un-correo",
  "descripcion": "Descripción lo suficientemente larga para pasar la validación mínima",
  "prioridad": "alta"
}

###

### Create Request – Invalid catalog value (422 Unprocessable Entity)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/solicitudes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identificador_externo": "EXT-ERR-002",
  "tipo": "tipo_que_no_existe",
  "nombre_solicitante": "Test User",
  "correo": "test@example.com",
  "descripcion": "Descripción lo suficientemente larga para pasar la validación mínima",
  "prioridad": "alta"
}

###

### List all requests
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/solicitudes
Accept: application/json

###

### List requests – filter by estado
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/solicitudes?estado=recibida
Accept: application/json

###

### List requests – filter by tipo and prioridad
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/solicitudes?tipo=soporte_tecnico&prioridad=alta
Accept: application/json

###

### Get specific request – replace <id> with a real UUID from POST response
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/solicitudes/<id>
Accept: application/json

###

### Get request – non-existent UUID (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/v1/solicitudes/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###

### Update estado → en_proceso (replace <id> with a real UUID)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/v1/solicitudes/<id>/estado
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": "en_proceso"
}

###

### Update estado → completada
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/v1/solicitudes/<id>/estado
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": "completada"
}

###

### Update estado – invalid value (422 Unprocessable Entity)
PATCH http://localhost:8000/api/v1/solicitudes/<id>/estado
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "estado": "pendiente"
}
